OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 17 Sep to Sat 26 Sep
OL,6,FRemaining changeable, with occasional
OL,7,Frain or showers arriving from the
OL,8,FNorth Atlantic, most frequent across
OL,9,Fnorthern and western parts of the UK,
OL,10,Fwhere some strong winds will also be
OL,11,Fpossible at times. However, there will
OL,12,Falso be some reasonably dry and more
OL,13,Fsettled periods interspersed,
OL,14,Fespecially across southern areas.
OL,15,FTemperatures for the period as a whole
OL,16,Fwill probably be close to average
OL,17,Foverall, but there is scope for some
OL,18,Frather warm days at times, along with
OL,19,Foccasional relatively cool nights
OL,20,Fgiving the occasional grass frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
